31:["$","section",null,{"className":"brand-story","id":"story","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"brand-story__visual","data-reveal":true,"children":["$","img",null,{"src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/DHVJGJBJ.png?v=1769092412&width=1600","alt":"Haxxed brand artwork for Indian men's grooming","loading":"lazy"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"brand-story__copy","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"micro-label","children":"How it all started"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Our story."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"brand-story-verbatim","children":[["$","p","It never started as a business. It started with a passion.\nFor years, I struggled to find the right hair product in the Indian market. Everything I found was “one product for everyone”—no consideration for different hair types, no options for different hair styles, and definitely no real performance.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"It never started as a business. It started with a passion.\nFor years, I struggled to find the right hair product in the Indian market. Everything I found was “one product for everyone”—no consideration for different hair types, no options for different hair styles, and definitely no real performance."]}]]}],["$","p","Most products used harsh chemicals, felt cheap, and gave disappointing results. My hair deserved better—and so did every Indian man.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"Most products used harsh chemicals, felt cheap, and gave disappointing results. My hair deserved better—and so did every Indian man."]}]]}],["$","p","When I looked outside India, I saw a completely different world. International brands were using clean ingredients, focusing on performance, and offering a huge range based on hair needs. But getting those products shipped to India was expensive—almost nobody could afford using them regularly.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"When I looked outside India, I saw a completely different world. International brands were using clean ingredients, focusing on performance, and offering a huge range based on hair needs. But getting those products shipped to India was expensive—almost nobody could afford using them regularly."]}]]}],["$","p","That frustration turned into curiosity.\nCuriosity turned into experimentation.\nAnd experimentation turned into a mission.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"That frustration turned into curiosity.\nCuriosity turned into experimentation.\nAnd experimentation turned into a mission."]}]]}],["$","p","Because the problem wasn’t mine alone—almost every Indian man faces the same struggle.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"Because the problem wasn’t mine alone—almost every Indian man faces the same struggle."]}]]}],["$","p","So HAXXED was born.\nNot to sell.\nNot to follow trends.\nBut to create what didn’t exist in India.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"So "]}],["$","span","1",{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"HAXXED"}]," was born.\nNot to sell.\nNot to follow trends.\nBut to create what didn’t exist in India."]}]]}],["$","p","We spent 3+ years in R&D for each product testing, failing, improving.. until we could match international quality, performance, and ingredient safety, at a price that makes sense for Indian consumers.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"We spent 3+ years in R&D for each product testing, failing, improving.. until we could match international quality, performance, and ingredient safety, at a price that makes sense for Indian consumers."]}]]}],["$","p","Indian men deserve world class hair products.\nMade for our hair types, our styles, and our climate.\nThis isn’t just hair styling.\nThis is passion, science, and pride.\nMade in/for India.",{"children":["$L5e"]}]]}],"$L5f"]}]]}]
